# VenInspect — agent context

## What this is

Field + web app for **bridge, drainage (culvert), and noise wall** inspections (Ventia / road assets).

- Dev repo (Gitea): http://192.168.13.9:3000/McKraken/VenInspect (`origin`)
- Live repo (GitHub): https://github.com/McKrackenAU/VenInspect (`github`)
- Local path: `D:\Projects\VenInspect`
- Production: **Proxmox LXC** — SQLite on `DATA_DIR`, photos on optional `PHOTO_DIR`

## Two portals

| Portal | Routes | Purpose |
|--------|--------|---------|
| **User** | `/`, `/assets`, `/inspect`, `/inspections/*`, `/approvals` | Field inspections, reports, L2 approvals, **scope export** |
| **Management** | `/manage/*` | Registry by **road → asset**, import, **photo storage path**, users |

Do not put asset import / storage config / user admin in the user portal.

## Mobile

Mobile-first field UI + PWA install. Future native shells via Capacitor — keep one codebase.

## Storage

- `DATA_DIR` → `veninspect.db` + `settings.json` (lightweight)
- `PHOTO_DIR` → photos (default `{DATA_DIR}/photos`; override via env or `/manage/storage`)
- Layout: `{PHOTO_DIR}/{Road}/{Code}/{DDMMYYYY|DDMMYYYY-HHmmss}/{defectCode}.webp`
- Inspection fields: `folderKey`, `titleLabel` e.g. `Kororoit Creek Road - SN1234 - 19072026`
- Always set `submittedAt` (time) for same-day disambiguation

## Assets

- Group by `roadName`, then `assetNumber` (Code)
- Types: `BRIDGE` | `DRAINAGE` | `NOISE_WALL`
- Sub-classification e.g. `PED_UNDERPASS` (Ped underpass) via `subClassification`
- Chainage: `chainageFrom` / `chainageTo` (import + manage details)
- Import: `src/lib/asset-import.ts` / `POST /api/manage/asset-import` + template with AV ID

## Inspection relations & scope

- Parent/child via `relationKind` + `parentInspectionId`; combine on asset page
- Scope: `/inspections/[id]/scope` — select defects → Print/PDF works scope

## Brand (Ventia)

Dark green `#004825`, mid `#00994D`, blue `#0077C8`, ink `#2A2A2A`, tint `#F6FAEF`. Light UI. Logos in `public/brand/` when licensed.

## Auth (planned — do not implement until asked)

Microsoft Entra ID for work MFA. Stubs in `.env.example`. `User.microsoftOid` reserved.

## Stack

Next.js · Prisma · SQLite · Sharp · xlsx · Tailwind
